# Weakens H's HandOffBound in this module's environment: a foreign append is
# allocated while L's marker is closed, above the closedAt the last close recorded.
# Nothing holds L, so its live advance passes the foreign record. Shows the
# assumption is load-bearing.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeForeignAfterClose
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a foreign append is allocated whether or not L's marker is open
PERTURBS: ForeignAlloc

--- FIND
ForeignAlloc ==
    /\ UNCHANGED <<armVars, moveVars>>
    /\ hoOpen \/ ~mInit

--- REPLACE
ForeignAlloc ==
    /\ UNCHANGED <<armVars, moveVars>>
\* MUTATION: no open marker needed.

--- END
